  "html": "<section id=\"cw-layout-letter\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #fcfdf8; border: 1px solid #c9d6c9; box-sizing: border-box; color: #304637; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 22px; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(252, 253, 248); background-image: url(&quot;data:image/png;base64,&quot;); background-position: right top; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 200px 200px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(70, 113, 81); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 70, 55); margin: 0px auto; max-width: 100%; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; width: 88%;\"><p style=\"color: rgb(48, 70, 55); font-size: 17px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0px; text-align: left;\">开场第一段：比赛结束后，人们先看到了比分。阅读一篇文章，也需要先交代背景，让读者知道事情从哪里开始。</p></section><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\">开场第二段：比分接近，真正需要讨论的是关键时刻的判断。连续的正文应留在同一个阅读容器里，左右都应有清楚的留白。</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\">开场第三段：接下来再进入具体章节。段落数量改变时，不应丢失内容，不应贴边，也不应为每段重复一层巨大的卡片内边距。</p><p style=\"background-color: #edf3e8; box-sizing: border-box; color: #304637; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 12px 20px; padding: 6px; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px auto 28px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 6px 0 12px; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #467151; color: #304637; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 12px; padding: 0 0 8px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong style=\"font-weight: 700\">重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p><section style=\"margin: 20px auto 20px; padding: 10px 0 10px; width: 84%\"><blockquote style=\"border-left: 1px solid #467151; color: #304637; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 0; padding-left: 16px; text-align: left\"><p style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote></section><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px auto 28px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 6px 0 12px; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #467151; color: #304637; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 12px; padding: 0 0 8px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2><ul style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; padding-left: 22px\"><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul><p style=\"background-color: #edf3e8; box-sizing: border-box; color: #304637; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 12px 20px; padding: 6px; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><p style=\"background-color: #edf3e8; box-sizing: border-box; color: #304637; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 12px 20px; padding: 6px; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; margin: 20px 0 20px; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color: #467151; border: 1px solid #c9d6c9; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">检查项</th><th style=\"background-color: #467151; border: 1px solid #c9d6c9; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6c9; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">标题</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6c9; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">第一眼能否找到主题</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6c9; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">正文</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6c9; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">是否能够连续阅读</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6c9; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">引用</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6c9; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">是否与作者叙述区分</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"background-color: #edf3e8; box-sizing: border-box; color: #304637; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 12px 20px; padding: 6px; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px auto 28px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 6px 0 12px; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #467151; color: #304637; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 12px; padding: 0 0 8px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\">把风格落实到每一个细节</h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\">报纸用硬边栏线建立秩序，杂志用大留白放慢速度，信笺让段落像一次自然的交谈。</p><p style=\"background-color: #edf3e8; box-sizing: border-box; color: #304637; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 12px 20px; padding: 6px; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\">一个完整的句子，不应该为了装饰被删掉。一张原有的表格，也不应该被换成没有事实来源的数字。</p><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 20px 0 0 auto; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 12px 0 0; text-align: right; width: 100%\"><p style=\"color: #304637; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 0; text-align: left\">读完之后，留下一个清楚的观点，比留下许多重复的色块更有价值。</p></section></section></section></section>",
  "name": "青叶信笺"
}
